## 2. Deploy ONE Single Project on Vercel

You only need **ONE** project on Vercel now.

1. Go to your [Vercel Dashboard](https://vercel.com/dashboard).
2. Click **Add New...** > **Project**.
3. Select your GitHub repository: `greathire-teamora-deployment-vercel` and click **Import**.
4. Configure Project Settings:
   - **Project Name**: Choose a clean, fresh name like `greathire-teamora` or `teamora-portal`
   - **Framework Preset**: `Other`
   - **Root Directory**: Leave as default (`./` - do not select backend or frontend)
   - **Build Command**: `npm run build`
   - **Output Directory**: `frontend/dist`
